{"branch":"가좌점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">가좌점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-a097991827c60f1f.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"가좌점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-a097991827c60f1f.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 서대문구 가재울로 52 승우빌딩 301호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 지하철</h3><ul class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-line\">경의중앙선</span><span>가좌역</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>남가좌현대아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>남가좌동아이파크정문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>남가좌동아이파크후문</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>DMC에코자이아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>명지대사거리</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>명지대사거리.백련시장</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>DMC쌍용.래미안루센티아</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>명지대사거리.국민은행앞</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>래미안루센티아.DMC쌍용</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>가재울초등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>가재울초등학교</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">12</span><span>DMC센트럴아이파크아파트</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>272</span><span>N75(심야)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>마포0